id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak i\\in V\">\\(\\mathfrak i\\in V\\)</span> (cardinal candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCiIndependenceNumber}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCiIndependenceNumber}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IndFam}_\\omega,\\mathrm{MaxIndFam}_\\omega\">\\(\\mathrm{IndFam}_\\omega,\\mathrm{MaxIndFam}_\\omega\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite},\\mathrm{Infinite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite},\\mathrm{Infinite}\\)</span> (finiteness predicates, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"be9675f035d2c1e2\" href=\"?note=be9675f035d2c1e2\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-infinite.md\">../batch06/58-df-infinite.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}independent\\text{-}family} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{IndFam}_\\omega(\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal G)\\land\n\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathcal G=\\emptyset\\land\\mathcal F\\cup\\mathcal G\\neq\\emptyset\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Infinite}\\bigl(\\{n\\in\\omega\\mid\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(n\\in A)\\land\n\\forall B\\in\\mathcal G\\;(n\\notin B)\\}\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}independent\\text{-}family} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{IndFam}_\\omega(\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal G)\\land\n\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathcal G=\\emptyset\\land\\mathcal F\\cup\\mathcal G\\neq\\emptyset\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Infinite}\\bigl(\\{n\\in\\omega\\mid\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(n\\in A)\\land\n\\forall B\\in\\mathcal G\\;(n\\notin B)\\}\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}independent\\text{-}family} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{MaxIndFam}_\\omega(\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{IndFam}_\\omega(\\mathcal I)\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\setminus\\mathcal I\\;\n\\neg\\mathrm{IndFam}_\\omega(\\mathcal I\\cup\\{A\\})\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}independent\\text{-}family} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{MaxIndFam}_\\omega(\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{IndFam}_\\omega(\\mathcal I)\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\setminus\\mathcal I\\;\n\\neg\\mathrm{IndFam}_\\omega(\\mathcal I\\cup\\{A\\})\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}independence\\text{-}number} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCiIndependenceNumber}_S(\\mathfrak i)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak i)\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal I\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{MaxIndFam}_\\omega(\\mathcal I)\\land|\\mathcal I|=\\mathfrak i\n\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal J\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{MaxIndFam}_\\omega(\\mathcal J)\\to\\neg(|\\mathcal J|&lt;\\mathfrak i)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}independence\\text{-}number} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCiIndependenceNumber}_S(\\mathfrak i)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak i)\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal I\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{MaxIndFam}_\\omega(\\mathcal I)\\land|\\mathcal I|=\\mathfrak i\n\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal J\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{MaxIndFam}_\\omega(\\mathcal J)\\to\\neg(|\\mathcal J|&lt;\\mathfrak i)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The least-cardinal condition is written by existence plus minimality, so the definition does not presuppose a global <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min\">\\(\\min\\)</span> operator or silently assume its domain is nonempty.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-infinite.md","status":"resolved","id":"be9675f035d2c1e2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor